{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plinbo</strong> offers a unique gaming experience that blends strategy and luck, where each run lets you choose different card and challenge combinations in a roguelike style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948580/extras/aaed287c2b3efbe07a3ade32a3dd5a04.poster.avif?t=1757969166\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948580/extras/aaed287c2b3efbe07a3ade32a3dd5a04.webm?t=1757969166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948580/extras/aaed287c2b3efbe07a3ade32a3dd5a04.mp4?t=1757969166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Each turn:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your deck through strategic decisions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take risks by joining challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape your experience with your choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight to reach the target money.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948580/extras/74fcccf16a6350f221901b1829b8fef7.poster.avif?t=1757969166\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948580/extras/74fcccf16a6350f221901b1829b8fef7.webm?t=1757969166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948580/extras/74fcccf16a6350f221901b1829b8fef7.mp4?t=1757969166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Strategy and Innovation</strong><br>With various card and challenge combinations, every run offers a new journey and a different strategic challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tarot cards that uniquely shape your experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-risk, turn-based challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Luck cards that instantly change your game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some cards keep you standing in the early game\u2026 others shine in the late stages. Some will always be by your side.<br>Find the best synergy with the right combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948580/extras/9ea77018f15fb5d3486c715d675ed558.poster.avif?t=1757969166\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948580/extras/9ea77018f15fb5d3486c715d675ed558.webm?t=1757969166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948580/extras/9ea77018f15fb5d3486c715d675ed558.mp4?t=1757969166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing and Enjoyable Atmosphere</strong><br>The clash of balls, the flying coins, and the activation of cards\u2026 Plinbo offers not only intelligence and strategy but also a visual feast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect physics-based ball movements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modern retro feel with CRT effect.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Satisfying visual and sound effects.</p></li>